msgctxt "sell.howBody"
msgid "Your inventory is ranked by priority - what to list right now from price, turnover, and bounded DE usage. Review the prices, then <b>List on WFM</b> posts them hidden so no buyer sees them until you flip them visible in <b>My orders</b>."
